[{"answer":"Oh hi, Marlon. I didn't hear you come in.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Shower's too loud? Boy, you sure take long ones.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Doesn't your mother complain?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Every time. She says I double the water bill.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/4.mp3"},{"answer":"I can believe it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/5.mp3"},{"answer":"But a shower doesn't use nearly as much water as taking a bath does.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/6.mp3"},{"answer":"'Course, you wouldn't know- you don't use either one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Haw! You'd know if I didn't.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/8.mp3"},{"answer":"You wouldn't be able to breathe in here right now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/9.mp3"},{"answer":"What's the occasion?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/10.mp3"},{"answer":"It's Rush Week, my man.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/11.mp3"},{"answer":"I've got a fraternity to check out tonight. Omega Theta.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Omega Theta? Really?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/13.mp3"},{"answer":"They rushed you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/14.mp3"},{"answer":"That's a feather in your cap. Everybody says they're really cool.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, they are. But they've also got a good reputation for academics, too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/16.mp3"},{"answer":"They've got the highest GPA on Fraternity Row.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm, that means you're gonna have to keep up your average, too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, but I figure that'll be easier to do with a little help from some Omega Theta friends.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/19.mp3"},{"answer":"You've got friends there?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/20.mp3"},{"answer":"I will if I join.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/21.mp3"},{"answer":"They've got a pretty strict study regimen:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/22.mp3"},{"answer":"everyone gets assigned a tutor, an upper-class brother, kind of an academic buddy system.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/23.mp3"},{"answer":"They say it works good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Sounds good if you need that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/25.mp3"},{"answer":"And I do. I'm not a self-starter at all.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Left to myself, I tend to fiddle around and get nothing done.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Me too, I guess,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/28.mp3"},{"answer":"if I go to the library or the coffee shop to study, I do better,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/29.mp3"},{"answer":"but if I sit around here, I just dawdle.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/30.mp3"},{"answer":"I listen to music or pick at the guitar or, uh, anything to avoid getting down to my assignments.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/31.mp3"},{"answer":"That's why I think Omega Theta is a good idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/32.mp3"},{"answer":"But what about the really important stuff?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Huh? What's that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Their parties!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/35.mp3"},{"answer":"They don't have much of a rep as a party house.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/36.mp3"},{"answer":"No, they don't.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Well? Isn't that the main reason for joining a fraternity - to party and meet girls?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Haha, for some guys, I guess so, yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/39.mp3"},{"answer":"I like to party too, but not every weekend like the Delta Taus do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, that's a real animal house, talk about reputation!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, probably a little much for me, too, when I think about it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/42.mp3"},{"answer":"We gotta stay a bit serious, after all, we gotta find jobs when we leave here!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Anyway, Omega Theta does throw a good party or two along the way,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/44.mp3"},{"answer":"just before Christmas and Easter break, and at Halloween, of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh boy! I hope you'll invite me to that one! I love Halloween parties!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure, if I can, but I haven't been invited to join yet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yeah, I forgot.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I want to hear how it goes tonight.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/49.mp3"},{"answer":"You bet. Reception's at six-thirty, dinner's at seven.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/50.mp3"},{"answer":"There'll be some talking and a tour of the house and some one-on-one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/51.mp3"},{"answer":"No alcohol, I think.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/52.mp3"},{"answer":"So I should be back here by 9:30 or 10 at the latest.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Then I'll spill all.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Hey! I just thought of something!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/55.mp3"},{"answer":"If you join Omega Theta and move into their house,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/56.mp3"},{"answer":"what am I gonna do for a roommate?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/57.mp3"},{"answer":"No, no, you're stuck with me for a while yet in any case.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/58.mp3"},{"answer":"They don't have freshman residents, just upper classmen, and not a lot of those.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/59.mp3"},{"answer":"It's not a big house.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/60.mp3"},{"answer":"How many are staying there anyway?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/61.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't know, about a dozen or so, I think.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/62.mp3"},{"answer":"I think they've got five or six bedrooms.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/63.mp3"},{"answer":"Everybody else is in the dorms or off campus.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/64.mp3"},{"answer":"But they've got a big hall that'll hold thirty or forty brothers for meetings and cram sessions and things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Huh! Well, I don't want to hold you up. It's almost six o'clock now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/66.mp3"},{"answer":"What? Yipes! I gotta get dressed and get outta here!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/67.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll leave you to it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/68.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm going over to the Campus Club and see if there's a good movie on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Don't you have anything better to do?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Naw. No one's rushing me tonight.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe it's the garlic I ate at lunch.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Couldn't be your personality, could it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks. You're my pal, too. Lock the door when you leave, will you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Yep. See you about 10?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/75.mp3"},{"answer":"If the movie's over. If there is one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Otherwise, I'll just be hanging out back here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/77.mp3"},{"answer":"OK. See you later.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/78.mp3"},{"answer":"See you. Have fun!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-11-2023-02-08-10-38-21/79.mp3"}]
